{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Talking About the Future"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Don't Ask Me"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses vs. Regular Future Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\"> Future Continuous tense</span> to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. <br> Look at the chart for a comparison of the other future tenses.  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talk about a things that are not decided; <br/>make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future; <br/>make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I probably <span class=\\\"strong\\\">won't be</span> able to make it.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'m going to go</span> to a shindig.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What <span class=\\\"strong\\\">are you planning</span> on doing over the next few years?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you talk about schedules\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My deadline <span class=\\\"strong\\\">is</span> early morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ll be sitting</span> at my desk and cranking out material.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have worked</span> freelance for a full year in a couple of months. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What are you planning on doing over the next few years?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have worked freelance for a full year in a couple of months. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "By this time next year, I'll have found that position and made some money.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I haven't, I'll be starting up my own company. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "My five year plan is that I'll have become more stable financially and more secure in my career. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll be sitting at my desk and cranking out material."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll be writing solidly, so I probably won't be able to make it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense </span> is: <br> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + <span class=\"italic\">be</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> is: <br> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will </span>+ <span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le14ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "secure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "firmly established, as a relationship or reputation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll have become more stable financially and more secure in my career."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about personal qualities and job plans."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shindig"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a party"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to go to a shindig."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a host of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200blarge \u200bnumber of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  There is a host of other professions linked to yours."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "solidly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having relative firmness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll be writing solidly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move to or from a position"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think it's a good idea to get out there. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hermit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who chooses to live alone or spend most of their time alone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've been a bit of a hermit lately."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shmooze"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "talk with someone in a friendly and informal way, often for personal gain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think it's a good idea to get out there and shmooze with people."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I think and create a timeline about the future of my career."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my future career goals."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask about a friends future career goals."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of your future in 5, 10 and 20 years from now."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a timeline of the events you think will happen related to your career for each time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about your goals with a friend using the timeline. (Use prese